bark-rs runs Underdog Bark 3.0 (ConwayResearch/Underdog-Bark-3.0) by Conway Research.
The model file (model.bark) is not part of this repository; download it from
https://huggingface.co/ConwayResearch/Underdog-Bark-3.0

The graphs in graphs/ (network structure without weights), vocab.json and the decoding
conventions derive from that model, which derives from:

  nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3, (c) NVIDIA Corporation, CC-BY-4.0
    https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3
  moondream/parakeet-ultra, (c) Moondream, CC-BY-4.0
    https://huggingface.co/moondream/parakeet-ultra

License: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Changes made here: exported to ONNX, weights removed from the graphs and rebuilt at load
time from model.bark, encoder matrices repacked as 2-bit ternary MatMulNBits terms (or
8-bit) that reproduce the stored weights.
